          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Binocular observation of a bright point moving in a zigzag pattern in the sky: probable airplane observation with a perceptual illusion (flashing lights and autokinesis).",
          "translation_text_sha256": "5288d6dcb3fd270232ab5db06fdd9f654cb8ed1530c6bd41afebcf8cc9dcbdde"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
